{"id":180,"date":"2026-07-27T14:39:00","date_gmt":"2026-07-27T12:39:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jdworld-os.netbird.cloud\/?p=180"},"modified":"2026-10-27T08:10:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T07:10:02","slug":"jdwos-qge-quickemu-e-quickgui","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/jdwos-packages\/mr_jack\/180\/","title":{"rendered":"JDWOS-QGE (QuickEMU e QuickGUI)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Questo pacchetto nativo per il JDWorld OS contiene sia il QuickEMU che il QuickGUI.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udce6 Scheda Tecnica del Pacchetto<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Name<\/strong>: JDWorld OS QuickEMU + QuickGUI (<strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-luminous-vivid-amber-color\">jdwos-qge.jdw<\/mark><\/strong>)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Architecture<\/strong>: Nativa Indipendente (x86_64)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Distro<\/strong>: Arch Linux<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>License(s)<\/strong>: Simplified BSD License<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Maintainers<\/strong>: JDWorld<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Package Size<\/strong>: 25 MB<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Update Date<\/strong>: 2026-07-27<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udce6 Scheda Tecnica QuickEMU<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Name<\/strong>: QuickEMU<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>License(s)<\/strong>: MIT-License<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Versione<\/strong>: 4.4.9<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Relaese data:<\/strong> 10-02-2026<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Github:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/quickemu-project\/quickemu\">https:\/\/github.com\/quickemu-project\/quickemu<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udce6 Scheda Tecnica QuickGUI<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Name<\/strong>: QuickGUI<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>License(s)<\/strong>: MIT-License<\/li>\n\n\n